# Build context exclusions.
#
# WHY THIS FILE IS NOT OPTIONAL
# -----------------------------
# backend/Dockerfile does `COPY . /app`. Without this file that copies, in order of severity:
#
#   1. backend/config.json -- live SQL credentials and the LLM API keys. It is gitignored, so it
#      is not in the repo, but it IS on any machine that has run the app, and a local
#      `docker build` would bake it into an image layer and push it to the registry. Layers are
#      not secret. This is the single most important line in this file.
#   2. backend/config.json.bak* -- the same secrets under a different name. The copy on the dev
#      machine carries the SQL password and three separate API keys.
#   3. results/ -- tens of megabytes of test evidence. Not one byte is needed at runtime.
#   4. .git/, __pycache__/, .venv/ -- noise that invalidates the layer cache on every commit.
#
# Secrets reach the container as ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES at run time (sql_backend.load_config
# prefers env over the file), never as build args and never as a copied file.

# ---- secrets: never in an image ------------------------------------------------------------
backend/config.json
backend/config.json.*
backend/config.*.json
config.json
config.json.*
.env
backend/.env
*.env
!backend/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx

# ---- source data: gitignored, large, not needed at runtime ---------------------------------
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv

# ---- test evidence: runtime-irrelevant -----------------------------------------------------
results/
canary-*/
*.har

# ---- version control and tooling -----------------------------------------------------------
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/

# ---- python build noise --------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---- docs: keep the image lean -------------------------------------------------------------
# Both consoles ARE needed and are deliberately not excluded:
#   agents_console.html  -- the multi-agent UI this branch serves
#   rca_console.html     -- the original engine's UI
IMP_DOCS/
*.md
!backend/README.md
Gemini_Generated_Image*.png
*.log

# ---- local run artefacts -------------------------------------------------------------------
*.sqlite
*.db
nohup.out
